/* ΓöÇΓöÇ Network constellation (light ┬╖ left/right) ΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇ */

.constellation {
  background:
    radial-gradient(
      ellipse 50% 45% at 15% 20%,
      color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 12%, transparent),
      transparent 62%
    ),
    radial-gradient(
      ellipse 45% 40% at 90% 70%,
      color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 8%, transparent),
      transparent 68%
    ),
    var(--surface);
}

.constellation-bg {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  background-image:
    linear-gradient(color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 5%, transparent) 1px, transparent 1px),
    linear-gradient(90deg, color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 5%, transparent) 1px, transparent 1px);
  background-size: 36px 36px;
  mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 70% at 50% 45%, black, transparent 90%);
  opacity: 0.5;
}

.constellation-orb {
  position: absolute;
  border-radius: 999px;
  pointer-events: none;
  filter: blur(42px);
  opacity: 0.5;
}

.constellation-orb-a {
  top: 12%;
  left: 4%;
  width: 12rem;
  height: 12rem;
  background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 20%, transparent);
}

.constellation-orb-b {
  right: 4%;
  bottom: 10%;
  width: 14rem;
  height: 14rem;
  background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary-soft) 85%, transparent);
}

.constellation-layout {
  min-height: 0;
}

.constellation-copy {
  max-width: 34rem;
}

.constellation-headline {
  font-family: inherit;
  font-style: italic;
  font-weight: 600;
  font-size: clamp(2.15rem, 4.8vw, 3.75rem);
  line-height: 1.08;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  color: var(--foreground);
}

.constellation-accent {
  font-style: italic;
  color: var(--primary);
  font-weight: 600;
}

.constellation-copy-link {
  display: flex;
  width: 100%;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 0.65rem;
  border-radius: 0.65rem;
  padding: 0.45rem 0.55rem;
  text-align: left;
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  line-height: 1.4;
  transition: background 0.25s ease;
}

.constellation-copy-link:hover,
.constellation-copy-link[data-active="true"] {
  background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 8%, transparent);
}

.constellation-copy-dot {
  margin-top: 0.45rem;
  width: 6px;
  height: 6px;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 18%, transparent);
  transition: background 0.25s ease;
}

.constellation-copy-link[data-active="true"] .constellation-copy-dot {
  background: var(--primary);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 18%, transparent);
}

.constellation-stage {
  aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
  min-height: 20rem;
  max-height: min(36rem, 72vh);
  width: 100%;
  border-radius: 1.25rem;
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--border) 90%, var(--primary));
  background:
    linear-gradient(
      180deg,
      color-mix(in oklab, var(--background) 94%, transparent),
      color-mix(in oklab, var(--card) 90%, transparent)
    );
  box-shadow:
    0 28px 70px -48px color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 35%, transparent),
    inset 0 1px 0 color-mix(in oklab, var(--background) 80%, transparent);
}

.constellation-stage-label {
  position: absolute;
  top: 0.75rem;
  left: 1rem;
  right: 1rem;
  z-index: 3;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 9px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  text-transform: none;
  color: var(--muted-foreground);
  pointer-events: none;
}

.constellation-stage-meta {
  color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 75%, var(--muted-foreground));
}

.constellation-corner {
  position: absolute;
  z-index: 3;
  width: 14px;
  height: 14px;
  border-color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 55%, transparent);
  border-style: solid;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.constellation-corner-tl {
  top: 10px;
  left: 10px;
  border-width: 2px 0 0 2px;
}

.constellation-corner-tr {
  top: 10px;
  right: 10px;
  border-width: 2px 2px 0 0;
}

.constellation-corner-bl {
  bottom: 10px;
  left: 10px;
  border-width: 0 0 2px 2px;
}

.constellation-corner-br {
  right: 10px;
  bottom: 10px;
  border-width: 0 2px 2px 0;
}

.constellation-orbit {
  transform-origin: 50px 50px;
  animation: constellation-spin 28s linear infinite;
}

.constellation-orbit-slow {
  animation-duration: 42s;
  animation-direction: reverse;
}

@keyframes constellation-spin {
  to {
    transform: rotate(360deg);
  }
}

.constellation-branch {
  stroke-dasharray: 2.4 1.8;
  stroke-linecap: round;
  opacity: 0.5;
  animation: constellation-branch-pulse 2.2s ease-in-out infinite;
  transition:
    stroke-width 0.35s ease,
    opacity 0.35s ease;
}

.constellation-branch[data-active="true"] {
  opacity: 1;
  animation-duration: 1.35s;
}

@keyframes constellation-branch-pulse {
  0%,
  100% {
    stroke-dashoffset: 0;
    opacity: 0.35;
  }
  50% {
    stroke-dashoffset: -10;
    opacity: 1;
  }
}

.constellation-pulse-dot {
  filter: drop-shadow(0 0 1.5px color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 80%, transparent));
}

.constellation-glass {
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 22%, var(--border));
  background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--background) 72%, transparent);
  backdrop-filter: blur(18px) saturate(1.25);
  box-shadow:
    0 24px 60px -32px color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 22%, transparent),
    0 0 0 1px color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 10%, transparent);
  transition:
    transform 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1),
    box-shadow 0.45s ease;
}

.constellation-hub:hover .constellation-glass {
  transform: translateY(-2px) scale(1.015);
  box-shadow: 0 28px 64px -28px color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 40%, transparent);
}

.constellation-live {
  display: inline-block;
  width: 5px;
  height: 5px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: var(--primary);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 22%, transparent);
  animation: partner-blink 1.8s ease-in-out infinite;
}

.constellation-sat {
  z-index: 2;
  width: min(38vw, 10.5rem);
  animation: constellation-float 5.5s ease-in-out infinite;
}

.constellation-sat-inner {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  border-radius: 0.85rem;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--background) 86%, transparent);
  padding: 0.5rem 0.6rem;
  backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
  box-shadow: 0 12px 32px -26px color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 28%, transparent);
  transition:
    border-color 0.3s ease,
    background 0.3s ease,
    transform 0.3s ease,
    box-shadow 0.3s ease;
}

.constellation-sat-icon {
  display: flex;
  width: 1.85rem;
  height: 1.85rem;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border-radius: 0.5rem;
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 22%, transparent);
  background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 10%, transparent);
  color: var(--primary);
}

.constellation-sat-pip {
  width: 5px;
  height: 5px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: var(--primary);
}

.constellation-sat:hover .constellation-sat-inner,
.constellation-sat[data-active="true"] .constellation-sat-inner {
  border-color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 45%, transparent);
  background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 8%, var(--background));
  transform: translateY(-2px);
  box-shadow: 0 16px 36px -24px color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 45%, transparent);
}

.constellation-sat:focus-visible {
  outline: 2px solid var(--primary);
  outline-offset: 4px;
  border-radius: 0.9rem;
}

@keyframes constellation-float {
  0%,
  100% {
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) translateY(0);
  }
  50% {
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) translateY(-5px);
  }
}

@media (max-width: 1023px) {
  .constellation-layout {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }

  .constellation-copy {
    max-width: none;
  }

  .constellation-stage {
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1.05;
    max-height: none;
    min-height: 22rem;
  }
}

@media (max-width: 639px) {
  .constellation-sat {
    width: min(46vw, 9.25rem);
  }

  .constellation-hub {
    width: min(62%, 16rem) !important;
  }
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .constellation-branch,
  .constellation-sat,
  .constellation-live,
  .constellation-orbit {
    animation: none;
  }
}

/* ── Network constellation click stages (nc-*) — not scroll-pinned ── */

.nc-section {
  --nc-stage-ms: 1800ms;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  padding-block: 4rem;
}

.nc-layout {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
  align-items: start;
  gap: 1.75rem;
}

.nc-copy,
.nc-stage {
  min-width: 0;
}

.nc-chips {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 0.5rem;
}

.nc-chip {
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  background: var(--background);
  border-radius: 999px;
  padding: 0.45rem 0.85rem;
  font-size: 0.8125rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--muted-foreground);
  line-height: 1.2;
  transition:
    background 0.2s ease,
    border-color 0.2s ease,
    color 0.2s ease;
}

.nc-chip:hover,
.nc-chip-on {
  border-color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 45%, var(--border));
  background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 10%, var(--background));
  color: var(--primary);
}

.nc-chip:focus-visible {
  outline: 2px solid var(--primary);
  outline-offset: 2px;
}

.nc-rail {
  display: none;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.25rem;
}

.nc-rail-fill {
  display: block;
  height: 100%;
  transform: scaleX(0);
  transform-origin: left;
  background: var(--primary);
}

.nc-rail-fill-on {
  animation: nc-rail-fill var(--nc-stage-ms) linear forwards;
}

@keyframes nc-rail-fill {
  from {
    transform: scaleX(0);
  }
  to {
    transform: scaleX(1);
  }
}

.nc-globe-wrap {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 18rem;
  margin-inline: auto;
  aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.nc-globe {
  position: relative;
  aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
}

.nc-node {
  display: none;
  position: absolute;
  z-index: 2;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.625rem;
  transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  border-radius: 999px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  background: var(--background);
  padding: 0.625rem 1rem;
  box-shadow: 0 1px 2px color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 8%, transparent);
  transition:
    border-color 0.2s ease,
    box-shadow 0.2s ease;
}

.nc-node-on {
  z-index: 4;
  border-color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 40%, var(--border));
  box-shadow: 0 8px 24px -16px color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 45%, transparent);
}

.nc-node:focus-visible {
  outline: 2px solid var(--primary);
  outline-offset: 2px;
}

.nc-console {
  border-radius: 1rem;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  background: var(--background);
  padding: 1.25rem;
  box-shadow: 0 1px 2px color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 6%, transparent);
  /* Stage copy is reserved (ghost longest title/body) so 1.8s auto-advance
     never grows or shrinks this card — or the sections around it. */
  flex-shrink: 0;
  min-height: 16.75rem;
}

.nc-console-title,
.nc-console-body,
.nc-metric-label {
  position: relative;
}

.nc-console-ghost {
  display: block;
  visibility: hidden;
}

.nc-console-live {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  display: block;
}

.nc-dots {
  display: none;
}

@media (min-width: 640px) {
  .nc-section {
    padding-block: 6rem;
  }

  .nc-globe-wrap {
    max-width: 22rem;
  }
}

@media (min-width: 1024px) {
  .nc-section {
    /* svh, not dvh: dvh remeasures when the browser chrome shows/hides and
       recenters this flex column, which looks like the page bouncing. */
    height: 100vh;
    height: 100svh;
    max-height: 100svh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    padding-block: clamp(0.5rem, 1.5vh, 1.5rem);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .nc-section > .container-page {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    min-height: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    height: 100%;
    max-height: 100%;
  }

  .nc-layout {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    min-height: 0;
    max-height: 100%;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 24rem) minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: clamp(1rem, 2.2vw, 2.25rem);
  }

  .nc-copy,
  .nc-stage {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    min-height: 0;
    max-height: 100%;
  }

  .nc-stage {
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .nc-section .nc-copy h2 {
    margin-top: clamp(0.4rem, 1vh, 1rem);
    font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 1.05rem + 1.6vh, 2.25rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .nc-chips {
    display: none;
  }

  .nc-section .nc-rail {
    display: flex;
    margin-top: clamp(0.55rem, 1.4vh, 1.5rem);
    gap: clamp(0.05rem, 0.35vh, 0.25rem);
  }

  .nc-section .nc-rail button {
    gap: 0.65rem;
    padding-block: clamp(0.15rem, 0.55vh, 0.5rem);
    padding-inline: 0.65rem;
  }

  .nc-section .nc-rail button > span:first-child {
    width: clamp(1.7rem, 3vh, 2.25rem);
    height: clamp(1.7rem, 3vh, 2.25rem);
  }

  .nc-section .nc-ctas {
    margin-top: clamp(0.55rem, 1.4vh, 1.5rem);
    gap: 0.65rem;
  }

  .nc-section .nc-ctas a {
    padding-block: clamp(0.45rem, 0.9vh, 0.7rem);
    padding-inline: 1.25rem;
  }

  .nc-globe-wrap {
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    width: min(100%, 30rem, 42svh);
    height: auto;
    max-width: 30rem;
    max-height: 42svh;
    padding: clamp(2.1rem, 3.8vh, 3.25rem);
    overflow: visible;
  }

  .nc-globe {
    overflow: visible;
  }

  .nc-node {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    padding: 0.4rem 0.7rem;
  }

  .nc-node:hover {
    border-color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 30%, var(--border));
  }

  .nc-section .nc-console {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    min-height: 11.75rem;
    margin-top: clamp(0.4rem, 1vh, 1rem);
    padding: clamp(0.7rem, 1.3vh, 1.15rem) clamp(0.85rem, 1.4vh, 1.25rem);
  }

  .nc-section .nc-console-title {
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
    font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 0.7rem + 0.9vh, 1.2rem);
  }

  .nc-section .nc-console-body {
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .nc-section .nc-console-body .nc-console-ghost,
  .nc-section .nc-console-body .nc-console-live {
    display: -webkit-box;
    -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
    -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .nc-section .nc-console .nc-metric {
    margin-top: 0.55rem;
    padding-block: 0.4rem;
  }

  .nc-section .nc-console .nc-metric strong {
    font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 0.85rem + 1.1vh, 1.5rem);
  }

  .nc-section .nc-console ul {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    gap: 0.2rem;
  }

  .nc-section .nc-dots {
    display: block;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    margin-top: clamp(0.45rem, 1.1vh, 1rem);
  }
}

@media (min-width: 1024px) and (min-height: 900px) {
  .nc-globe-wrap {
    width: min(100%, 32rem, 46svh);
    max-width: 32rem;
    max-height: 46svh;
    padding: clamp(2.4rem, 4.2vh, 3.6rem);
  }

  .nc-node {
    gap: 0.55rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.85rem;
  }
}

@media (min-width: 1280px) and (min-height: 800px) {
  .nc-layout {
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 25rem) minmax(0, 1fr);
  }
}

@media (min-width: 1440px) and (min-height: 900px) {
  .nc-layout {
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 26rem) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 2.25rem;
  }
}

@media (min-width: 1512px) and (min-height: 960px) {
  .nc-globe-wrap {
    width: min(100%, 32rem, 48svh);
    max-height: 48svh;
  }
}

@media (min-width: 1680px) and (min-height: 1000px) {
  .nc-section {
    padding-block: clamp(0.85rem, 2vh, 1.75rem);
  }

  .nc-globe-wrap {
    width: min(100%, 34rem, 50svh);
    max-width: 34rem;
    max-height: 50svh;
  }
}

@media (min-width: 1920px) and (min-height: 1080px) {
  .nc-layout {
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 28rem) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 2.5rem;
  }

  .nc-globe-wrap {
    width: min(100%, 34rem, 52svh);
    max-width: 34rem;
    max-height: 52svh;
    padding: 3.5rem;
  }

  .nc-section .nc-console {
    padding: 1.15rem 1.35rem;
    min-height: 13.25rem;
  }

  .nc-section .nc-console-body .nc-console-ghost,
  .nc-section .nc-console-body .nc-console-live {
    -webkit-line-clamp: 3;
  }
}

@media (min-width: 2560px) and (min-height: 1400px) {
  .nc-globe-wrap {
    width: min(100%, 36rem, 48svh);
    max-width: 36rem;
    max-height: 48svh;
  }
}

@media (min-width: 1024px) and (max-height: 820px) {
  .nc-section .nc-copy h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.4vh, 1.65rem);
  }

  .nc-globe-wrap {
    width: min(100%, 26rem, 38svh);
    max-height: 38svh;
    padding: 2rem;
  }

  .nc-node {
    gap: 0.35rem;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.55rem;
  }

  .nc-node span:last-child span:last-child {
    display: none;
  }

  .nc-section .nc-console ul {
    display: none;
  }
}

@media (max-width: 639px) {
  .nc-section {
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .nc-console {
    padding: 1rem;
  }
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .nc-chip,
  .nc-node,
  .nc-dots span,
  .nc-rail-fill {
    transition: none;
  }

  .nc-rail-fill-on {
    animation: none;
    transform: scaleX(1);
  }
}

/* Network graph (scroll-driven build) */

/* ── Network graph (scroll-driven build) ───────────────────────── */

.netgraph {
  background:
    radial-gradient(
      ellipse 55% 45% at 18% 15%,
      color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 11%, transparent),
      transparent 62%
    ),
    radial-gradient(
      ellipse 50% 45% at 88% 80%,
      color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 8%, transparent),
      transparent 66%
    ),
    var(--surface);
}

.netgraph-viewport {
  display: none;
}

.netgraph-stack {
  padding-block: 3.5rem;
}

@media (min-width: 1024px) {
  .netgraph {
    height: 460vh;
  }

  .netgraph-viewport {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    display: block;
    height: 100dvh;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: inherit;
  }

  .netgraph-stack {
    display: none;
  }
}

.netgraph-grid {
  pointer-events: none;
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background-image:
    linear-gradient(
      color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 5%, transparent) 1px,
      transparent 1px
    ),
    linear-gradient(
      90deg,
      color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 5%, transparent) 1px,
      transparent 1px
    );
  background-size: 38px 38px;
  mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 78% 70% at 50% 48%, black, transparent 92%);
  opacity: 0.55;
}

.netgraph-orb {
  pointer-events: none;
  position: absolute;
  border-radius: 999px;
  filter: blur(60px);
  opacity: 0.55;
}

.netgraph-orb-a {
  top: 6%;
  left: 2%;
  width: 20rem;
  height: 20rem;
  background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 18%, transparent);
}

.netgraph-orb-b {
  right: 2%;
  bottom: 4%;
  width: 22rem;
  height: 22rem;
  background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary-soft) 90%, transparent);
}

.netgraph-shell {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  display: grid;
  height: 100%;
  grid-template-rows: auto minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
  gap: clamp(0.75rem, 2vh, 1.75rem);
  padding-block: clamp(1.5rem, 4vh, 3rem);
}

.netgraph-header {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 2rem;
}

.netgraph-eyebrow {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  border-radius: 999px;
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 22%, transparent);
  background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 8%, transparent);
  padding: 0.4rem 0.9rem;
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: clamp(0.875rem, 0.8rem + 0.35vw, 1.0625rem);
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  text-transform: none;
  color: var(--primary);
}

.netgraph-live {
  display: inline-block;
  width: 5px;
  height: 5px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: var(--primary);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 22%, transparent);
  animation: partner-blink 1.8s ease-in-out infinite;
}

.netgraph-headline {
  margin-top: 0.9rem;
  max-width: 30ch;
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 2.6vw, 2.6rem);
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.1;
  letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  color: var(--foreground);
  text-wrap: balance;
}

.netgraph-headline em {
  font-family: inherit;
  font-style: italic;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--primary-deep);
}

.netgraph-counter {
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  gap: 0.25rem;
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 40%, transparent);
}

.netgraph-counter-index {
  font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.75rem);
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1;
  color: var(--primary);
}

.netgraph-counter-total {
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
}

.netgraph-main {
  display: grid;
  min-height: 0;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(11rem, 15rem) minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(15rem, 20rem);
  align-items: center;
  gap: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 2.5rem);
}

/* Rail ---------------------------------------------------------- */

.netgraph-rail {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.55rem;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  list-style: none;
}

.netgraph-rail-item {
  position: relative;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr);
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.6rem;
  overflow: hidden;
  border-radius: 0.8rem;
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 7%, transparent);
  background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--background) 60%, transparent);
  padding: 0.6rem 0.7rem 0.75rem;
  transition:
    border-color 0.35s ease,
    background 0.35s ease,
    transform 0.35s ease;
}

.netgraph-rail-item[data-done="true"] {
  border-color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 22%, transparent);
}

.netgraph-rail-item[data-on="true"] {
  border-color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 45%, transparent);
  background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--background) 92%, transparent);
  transform: translateX(4px);
  box-shadow: 0 14px 32px -26px color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 45%, transparent);
}

.netgraph-rail-icon {
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  width: 1.9rem;
  height: 1.9rem;
  border-radius: 0.55rem;
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 8%, transparent);
  background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--background) 80%, transparent);
  color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 45%, transparent);
  transition:
    color 0.35s ease,
    border-color 0.35s ease,
    background 0.35s ease;
}

.netgraph-rail-item[data-on="true"] .netgraph-rail-icon {
  border-color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 35%, transparent);
  background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 10%, transparent);
  color: var(--primary);
}

.netgraph-rail-index {
  display: block;
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 9px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 38%, transparent);
}

.netgraph-rail-label {
  display: block;
  overflow: hidden;
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
  color: var(--foreground);
}

.netgraph-rail-bar {
  position: absolute;
  inset-inline: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  height: 2px;
  background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 7%, transparent);
}

.netgraph-rail-bar span {
  display: block;
  height: 100%;
  transform-origin: left;
  background: var(--primary);
}

/* Stage --------------------------------------------------------- */

.netgraph-stage {
  position: relative;
  width: min(100%, min(34rem, 52vh));
  margin-inline: auto;
  aspect-ratio: 1;
}

.netgraph-svg {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  overflow: visible;
}

.netgraph-orbit {
  transform-origin: 50px 50px;
  animation: netgraph-spin 34s linear infinite;
}

.netgraph-orbit-rev {
  animation-duration: 52s;
  animation-direction: reverse;
}

@keyframes netgraph-spin {
  to {
    transform: rotate(360deg);
  }
}

.netgraph-branch {
  transition:
    stroke-dashoffset 0.15s linear,
    stroke-width 0.35s ease;
}

.netgraph-packet {
  filter: drop-shadow(0 0 2px color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 85%, transparent));
}

.netgraph-hub {
  position: absolute;
  left: 50%;
  top: 50%;
  z-index: 3;
  display: flex;
  width: 9.5rem;
  height: 9.5rem;
  translate: -50% -50%;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 0.15rem;
  border-radius: 999px;
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 30%, transparent);
  background:
    radial-gradient(
      circle at 42% 35%,
      color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 14%, var(--background)),
      var(--background) 72%
    );
  box-shadow: 0 24px 60px -34px color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 55%, transparent);
  text-align: center;
}

.netgraph-hub-pulse {
  position: absolute;
  inset: -12%;
  border-radius: 999px;
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 25%, transparent);
  animation: netgraph-pulse 3.4s ease-out infinite;
}

@keyframes netgraph-pulse {
  0% {
    opacity: 0.8;
    transform: scale(0.92);
  }
  70% {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: scale(1.18);
  }
  100% {
    opacity: 0;
  }
}

.netgraph-hub-mark {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 1.6rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  color: var(--primary-deep);
}

.netgraph-hub-label {
  font-size: 0.72rem;
  font-weight: 650;
  color: var(--foreground);
}

.netgraph-hub-meta {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 9px;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  text-transform: none;
  color: var(--primary);
}

.netgraph-node {
  position: absolute;
  display: flex;
  width: 9rem;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  border-radius: 0.85rem;
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 8%, transparent);
  background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--background) 90%, transparent);
  padding: 0.5rem 0.6rem;
  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  box-shadow: 0 14px 30px -26px color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 30%, transparent);
  transition:
    border-color 0.35s ease,
    box-shadow 0.35s ease,
    background 0.35s ease;
}

.netgraph-node[data-on="true"] {
  border-color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 45%, transparent);
  background: var(--background);
  box-shadow: 0 18px 38px -22px color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 50%, transparent);
}

.netgraph-node-icon {
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  width: 1.75rem;
  height: 1.75rem;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  border-radius: 0.5rem;
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 22%, transparent);
  background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 10%, transparent);
  color: var(--primary);
}

.netgraph-node-title {
  display: block;
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--foreground);
}

.netgraph-node-metric {
  display: block;
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 9px;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  color: var(--primary);
}

/* Console ------------------------------------------------------- */

.netgraph-console {
  border-radius: 1.15rem;
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 8%, transparent);
  background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--background) 88%, transparent);
  padding: 1.2rem 1.25rem 1.35rem;
  backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
  box-shadow: 0 22px 50px -38px color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 35%, transparent);
  animation: netgraph-console-in 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) both;
}

@keyframes netgraph-console-in {
  from {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(12px);
  }
  to {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }
}

.netgraph-console-top {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 0.75rem;
}

.netgraph-console-tag {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  text-transform: none;
  color: var(--primary);
}

.netgraph-console-dot {
  width: 6px;
  height: 6px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: var(--primary);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 18%, transparent);
  animation: partner-blink 1.6s ease-in-out infinite;
}

.netgraph-console-title {
  margin-top: 0.65rem;
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 1.15rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.25;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  color: var(--foreground);
}

.netgraph-console-body {
  margin-top: 0.55rem;
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  line-height: 1.55;
  color: var(--muted-foreground);
}

.netgraph-console-metric {
  margin-top: 0.95rem;
  border-radius: 0.75rem;
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 20%, transparent);
  background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 7%, transparent);
  padding: 0.7rem 0.85rem;
}

.netgraph-console-metric strong {
  display: block;
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 1.75rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1;
  letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  color: var(--primary-deep);
}

.netgraph-console-metric span {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 0.25rem;
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 9px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  text-transform: none;
  color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 50%, transparent);
}

.netgraph-console-lines {
  margin: 0.9rem 0 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.3rem;
  padding: 0;
  list-style: none;
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 58%, transparent);
}

.netgraph-console-lines li {
  border-left: 2px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 35%, transparent);
  padding-left: 0.55rem;
  transition: opacity 0.25s linear;
}

.netgraph-console-cta {
  margin-top: 1.1rem;
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 0.5rem;
}

.netgraph-cta,
.netgraph-cta-ghost {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.4rem;
  border-radius: 999px;
  padding: 0.6rem 1.1rem;
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  transition:
    transform 0.25s ease,
    border-color 0.25s ease,
    color 0.25s ease;
}

.netgraph-cta {
  background: var(--primary);
  color: var(--primary-foreground);
}

.netgraph-cta-ghost {
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 14%, transparent);
  background: var(--background);
  color: var(--foreground);
}

.netgraph-cta:hover,
.netgraph-cta-ghost:hover {
  transform: translateY(-1px);
}

.netgraph-cta-ghost:hover {
  border-color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 40%, transparent);
  color: var(--primary);
}

/* Footer progress ----------------------------------------------- */

.netgraph-progress {
  position: relative;
  height: 3px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 8%, transparent);
}

.netgraph-progress-fill {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  transform-origin: left;
  border-radius: inherit;
  background: linear-gradient(
    90deg,
    color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 55%, transparent),
    var(--primary)
  );
}

.netgraph-progress-tick {
  position: absolute;
  top: 50%;
  width: 7px;
  height: 7px;
  translate: -50% -50%;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 14%, transparent);
  transition:
    background 0.3s ease,
    box-shadow 0.3s ease;
}

.netgraph-progress-tick[data-on="true"] {
  background: var(--primary);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 18%, transparent);
}

/* Mobile stack --------------------------------------------------- */

.netgraph-stack-card {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 0.85rem;
  border-radius: 1rem;
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 8%, transparent);
  background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--background) 90%, transparent);
  padding: 1rem;
}

.netgraph-stack-metric {
  flex-shrink: 0;
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--primary);
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .netgraph-orbit,
  .netgraph-hub-pulse,
  .netgraph-live,
  .netgraph-console,
  .netgraph-console-dot {
    animation: none;
  }
}

/* Market path scroll (GSAP POV curve · light) */

.market-path {
  background:
    radial-gradient(
      ellipse 55% 45% at 20% 20%,
      color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 10%, transparent),
      transparent 65%
    ),
    radial-gradient(
      ellipse 50% 40% at 85% 75%,
      color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 8%, transparent),
      transparent 68%
    ),
    var(--surface);
  color: var(--foreground);
}

.market-path-pin {
  display: none;
}

.market-path-stack {
  padding-block: 3.25rem 3.75rem;
}

@media (min-width: 1024px) {
  .market-path {
    height: 300vh;
  }

  .market-path-pin {
    display: block;
    height: 100dvh;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: inherit;
  }

  .market-path-stack {
    display: none;
  }
}

.market-path-glow {
  pointer-events: none;
  position: absolute;
  inset: 15% 8% 20%;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: radial-gradient(
    ellipse at center,
    color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 16%, transparent),
    transparent 70%
  );
  filter: blur(40px);
}

.market-path-grid {
  pointer-events: none;
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  opacity: 0.4;
  background-image:
    linear-gradient(
      color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 5%, transparent) 1px,
      transparent 1px
    ),
    linear-gradient(
      90deg,
      color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 5%, transparent) 1px,
      transparent 1px
    );
  background-size: 40px 40px;
  mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 75% 65% at 45% 50%, black, transparent 90%);
}

.market-path-chrome {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  display: grid;
  height: 100%;
  grid-template-rows: auto minmax(0, 1fr) auto auto;
  gap: 0.75rem;
  padding-block: clamp(1.1rem, 3vh, 2.25rem);
}

.market-path-header {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 1.5rem;
}

.market-path-headline {
  margin-top: 0.75rem;
  max-width: 22ch;
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 2.5vw, 2.35rem);
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.12;
  letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  color: var(--foreground);
  text-wrap: balance;
}

.market-path-lede {
  margin-top: 0.55rem;
  max-width: 42ch;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  line-height: 1.5;
  color: var(--muted-foreground);
}

.market-path-counter {
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  gap: 0.3rem;
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 40%, transparent);
}

.market-path-counter-sep {
  opacity: 0.45;
}

.market-path-stage {
  position: relative;
  display: grid;
  min-height: 0;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(15rem, 19rem);
  align-items: stretch;
  gap: 1.25rem;
}

.market-path-graph {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  min-height: 18rem;
  overflow: visible;
}

.market-path-readout {
  align-self: center;
  border-radius: 1.1rem;
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 8%, transparent);
  background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--background) 90%, transparent);
  padding: 1.15rem 1.2rem 1.25rem;
  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  box-shadow: 0 20px 48px -36px color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 30%, transparent);
  animation: market-path-readout-in 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) both;
}

@keyframes market-path-readout-in {
  from {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(10px);
  }
  to {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }
}

.market-path-readout-tag {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  text-transform: none;
  color: var(--primary);
}

.market-path-readout-title {
  margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 1.15rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  color: var(--foreground);
}

.market-path-readout-body {
  margin: 0.45rem 0 0;
  font-size: 0.84rem;
  line-height: 1.5;
  color: var(--muted-foreground);
}

.market-path-readout-metric {
  margin-top: 0.85rem;
  border-radius: 0.75rem;
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 22%, transparent);
  background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 7%, transparent);
  padding: 0.65rem 0.8rem;
}

.market-path-readout-metric strong {
  display: block;
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 1.65rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1;
  letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  color: var(--primary-deep);
}

.market-path-readout-metric span {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 0.2rem;
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 9px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  text-transform: none;
  color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 48%, transparent);
}

.market-path-readout-lines {
  margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.28rem;
  padding: 0;
  list-style: none;
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 58%, transparent);
}

.market-path-readout-lines li {
  border-left: 2px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 35%, transparent);
  padding-left: 0.5rem;
}

.market-path-rail {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 0.4rem 0.65rem;
  justify-content: flex-start;
}

.market-path-tick {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 9px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: none;
  color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 38%, transparent);
  transition:
    color 0.35s ease,
    opacity 0.35s ease;
}

.market-path-tick[data-on="true"] {
  color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 70%, var(--foreground));
}

.market-path-tick[data-active="true"] {
  color: var(--primary-deep);
}

.market-path-footer {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 1rem;
}

.market-path-progress {
  position: relative;
  flex: 1;
  height: 3px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 8%, transparent);
  overflow: hidden;
}

.market-path-progress span {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  transform-origin: left;
  border-radius: inherit;
  background: linear-gradient(
    90deg,
    color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 55%, transparent),
    var(--primary)
  );
}

.market-path-outro-cta {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 0.45rem;
}

.market-path-cta,
.market-path-cta-ghost {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.35rem;
  border-radius: 999px;
  padding: 0.5rem 0.95rem;
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  transition:
    transform 0.25s ease,
    border-color 0.25s ease,
    color 0.25s ease;
}

.market-path-cta {
  background: var(--primary);
  color: var(--primary-foreground);
}

.market-path-cta-ghost {
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 14%, transparent);
