   .prd-* .int-* .journey-num* .stats-wallet-* .mihp-*.
   Dark .toolkit shell is neutralized here � do not restore dark
   bg for this section. Document scroll; no 100svh / 340vh pin;
   overflow hidden both axes (never x-clip + y-visible).
   Size container stays on stable .toolkit-screen-* only.
   ============================================================ */

.toolkit.toolkit-light {
